	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Serius tua tibi remitto hanc solam ob causam, quod <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nullos certos multo iam tempore nuncios habere po<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tui; ignoscas ergo mihi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Porro gratias tibi pro his omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ago maximas et oro dominum, ut nos et ecclesias istas <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>omnes in illa doctrinae huius syncerissimae veritate <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>conservet.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cum quanto se offendiculo <placeName ref="l28">Basilienses</placeName> a nobis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>seiunxerint, quotidie audimus a multis; iam ap<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>paret, quid iam pridem parturierint; imo quod a nobis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>aperte dissentiant, non obscure fatetur <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerus</persName> in suis literis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nuper ad me scriptis, cuius verba descripta ad fratrem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mitto; is illa tibi communicabit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Rogo vero tuum super his <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>consilium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Novi habemus nihil, nisi quod iam pridem ad d. <persName ref="p8063">Steigerum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>scriptum est Gallos portum <placeName>Savonae</placeName> in <placeName ref="l2685">Liguria</placeName> non <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>procul a <placeName ref="l1121">Genua</placeName> situm opera Petri Corsi occupasse.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scriptum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>est hoc ipsum his diebus ad d. <persName>Petermannum</persName> ab <placeName ref="l993">Erlach</placeName>; si quid <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sit, non dubito, quin vos certiora habeatis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8063">Steigeri</persName> literae <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>etiam hoc habebant pontificem <placeName ref="l425">Romae</placeName> in castro S. Angeli esse <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>obsessum; sed a quibus, non continebatur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l301">Lugduni</placeName> sunt <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>novi motus, quos cient Iesuitae; petunt enim sibi quoque <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>templa dari, quo nostros e suis expellant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Regius legatus novus hic nuper fuit et valde ursit nostros <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ad recipiendum foedus commune.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Incipiunt ergo rursus cristas <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>erigere aliqui, qui vellent omnem disciplinam sublatam e<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sse, inter quos sunt potentiores aliqui; hos stimulat <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>suis scriptis, et illi eius authoritate plurimum nituntur, quem alias <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>cane peius et angue oderunt<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 2, 9, 63 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 676f).</note>, ut verear, quicquid dicamus, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>fore tandem, ut perrumpant illi.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Solo hoc foedere putant r<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>egi, nobis et communi evangelii causae consuli posse; <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>adhuc tamen per domini gratiam nondum consensum est.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Der küng <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>wil, wir söllind bsiglen, das ander Eidgnoßen bsiglet; was die <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>unseren imm vorbhaltend, da wil er weder brieff noch sigel gen, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>sonder allein von mund zuͦsagen.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Wir muuͤßen gsen, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>das si uns bschißen wend; inen ist nienerum, dann das s<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>i uns und unsere kind mißbruchind und uns zuͦ knechten <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>machind; si sind uns zlistig, und verfuͤrt uns ir gold.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Ist alles umb den <persName ref="p4541">Chrysostomum</persName> zthuͦn, wenn mans lang <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>machet.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Gott well uns trühlich bhuͤten.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Quid vero vester ille consul <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> aget cum suo <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>hoc Confoederatorum comitatu?</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8063">Steigerus</persName> rursus apud <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>nos consul creatus est et affinis illius <persName>Willadingus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>pandareta seu vennerus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Expectamus, quid novi <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> aut aliunde ex his nundinis acceperis; ea oramus <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ut nobis communices.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Nostri te omnes plurimum salutant, <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>inprimis vero <persName ref="p8063">Steigerus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 25. aprilis 1566.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Salutat te etiam vehementer <persName>Blasius</persName> meus, qui his diebus <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>hic mecum fuit.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/>Scripsisti aliquoties ad me de <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>historia <persName ref="p4508">Galeatii Capellae</persName> Germanica; ego nullum hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>exemplar reperire potui.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Nunc ad me unum allatum <lb xml:id="p1z51"/>est <placeName ref="l28">Basilea</placeName>; quodsi ergo nullum adhuc habes, scriba mihi, <lb xml:id="p1z52"/>et hoc tuum erit.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z53"/>Tuus perpetuo <lb xml:id="p1z54"/><persName ref="p8018">Johannes Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae antistiti vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et compatri <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>perpetua mihi observantia <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
